#!name=WiFiCalling-HK
#!desc=Hong Kong Wi-Fi Calling rules for Surge / Shadowrocket
#!category=WiFi Calling

# ============================================================
# WiFiCalling-HK
# ============================================================
#
# Merged from:
# - wzx-moe/surface-wifi-calling-surge-rules
# - LOWERTOP/Shadowrocket-First
#
# Optimized:
# - Deduplicated identical rules
# - Removed DOMAIN rules already covered by DOMAIN-SUFFIX
# - Preserved all MCC/MNC coverage from wzx-moe
# - Preserved carrier-specific rules from LOWERTOP
# - Preserved carrier IP fallback rules
#
# Structure:
# 01. Standard / Generic Wi-Fi Calling
# 02. Standard / 3GPP IMS & ePDG
# 03. Apple / Region Detection
# 04. Carrier Supplement / CSL
# 05. Carrier Supplement / CMHK
# 06. Carrier Supplement / 3 HK
# 07. Carrier IP Fallback
#
# ============================================================


# ============================================================
# 【01】标准规则 / Generic Wi-Fi Calling
# ============================================================

# IKE / IPsec Wi-Fi Calling
# UDP 500 / 4500
#
# LOWERTOP additionally included UDP 16384-16403.
# Kept here as an extended Wi-Fi Calling port range.
#
AND,((GEOIP,HK),(AND,((PROTOCOL,UDP),(OR,((DEST-PORT,500),(DEST-PORT,4500),(DEST-PORT,16384-16403))))))


# ============================================================
# 【02】标准规则 / 3GPP IMS & ePDG
# ============================================================

# 3GPP domain pattern:
# ims.mnc<MNC>.mcc<MCC>.3gppnetwork.org
#
# 3GPP public / ePDG domain pattern:
# epdg.epc.mnc<MNC>.mcc<MCC>.pub.3gppnetwork.org
#
# All observed Hong Kong MCC/MNC rows from wzx-moe are retained.


# ------------------------------------------------------------
# MCC-MNC: 454-00
# Hong Kong Telecommunications (HKT) / CSL
# ------------------------------------------------------------
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,mnc000.mcc454.3gppnetwork.org
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,mnc000.mcc454.pub.3gppnetwork.org

